<title>USA: Fidelity National elects new ops chief.</title>
<headline>Fidelity National elects new ops chief.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurance underwriter Fidelity National Financial Inc said its board has elected Patrick Stone as chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Stone had been president and chief operating officer of the company's major underwriting subsidiaries since May 1995 and would retain these positions, Fidelity National said.</p>
<p>New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
